WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:05.137
[cheerful music]

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:09.208
♪ ♪

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.476
- HEY, HEY. HOW YOU DOING?
- HOW YOU DOING?

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:12.078
WHAT'S GOING ON?
- HEY, WHAT'S UP?

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:14.046
- HOW YOU DOING, MAN?
[laughter]

00:00:14.046 --> 00:00:16.015
- COME ON--
[laughs]

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.183
- COME ON.
WHERE ARE YOU GOING?

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.951
- HEY. HEY, COME ON, MAN!
STOP IT.

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:20.053
STOP IT, STOP IT!
- HEY, HEY.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.821
- STOP IT.
- HEY, HEY.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.722
THAT'S FUN.
- THAT'S FUN, I LIKE IT!

00:00:23.722 --> 00:00:24.724
[overlapping chatter]
I'M HAVING A FUN TIME.

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:25.725
OW!

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:29.762
[overlapping shouting]

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:31.264
YOU'RE BIG!
YOU'RE BIG!

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:36.235
- [panting]

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:37.937
- [panting]
- HEY, HEY!

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.539
- I KNOW YOU, I KNOW YOU!
- OH, YEAH, I REMEMBER YOU.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.706
- I THINK I LIKE YOU.
LET ME--

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:42.208
- YEAH.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.877
both: NO! NO! NO!

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:46.445
- OH. OH.

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:48.548
HEY, WHAT YOU EATING?
WHAT ARE YOU EATING?

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.550
- GET THE [bleep] AWAY
FROM ME.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:52.585
- OH, BUT THAT'S FOOD.
- [bleep] OFF.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.119
- THAT'S FOOD, THOUGH.
- [bleep] OFF!

00:00:54.119 --> 00:00:57.189
- YEAH.
[laughs]

00:00:57.189 --> 00:00:58.391
I LIKE THAT.

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:02.061
I LIKE THE WAY YOU LOOK.
YOU LOOKING GOOD TO ME.

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:04.029
[sniffs]

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:05.498
YOU A DUDE, SORRY.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:08.368
- THAT'S OKAY!
IT HAPPENS!

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.509
- HEY!
WHAT'S UP THERE?

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:17.510
IS THERE--
IS THERE SOMETHING UP THERE?

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.677
- YES, YES.
- IS IT UP THERE?

00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:19.812
HEY, COME HERE!
- I WANT TO EAT YOU RIGHT NOW.

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:21.114
- YOU'RE UP THERE!
YOU ARE UP THERE!

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.581
- I WANT TO EAT YOU.
- NO! NO! GET OUT!

00:01:22.581 --> 00:01:24.551
GET OUT OF HERE!
GO, YOU CAN'T HAVE IT!

00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:26.085
- I WANT TO EAT IT!

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:28.588
- I SEE IT, COME HERE!

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:29.588
[applause]

